---
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';

const { owner, lastUpdated } = site.legal;
---
<TextPage
  title="Disclaimer"
  path="/disclaimer/"
  updated={lastUpdated}
  description={`Disclaimer for ${site.url.replace('https://', '')}: information accuracy, third-party music and videos, labels, external links and events.`}
>
  <h2>General information</h2>
  <p>
    The information on this site is provided by {owner} for general information about the label, its artists and its
    music. We try to keep it accurate and up to date, but we make no guarantee that it is complete, current or free of
    errors.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party music and labels</h2>
  <p>
    Some songs featured on this site were released by other record labels or are published on third-party YouTube
    channels. Where that is the case, the release page names the label. Those songs, videos and artwork remain the
    property of their owners. Names, logos and trademarks of labels, artists and services belong to their respective
    owners, and mentioning them does not imply endorsement.
  </p>

  <h2>YouTube and streaming</h2>
  <p>
    Songs play through YouTube's embedded player. Their availability depends on YouTube and the video owner: a video may
    be removed, made private or blocked in some countries at any time, outside our control.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Links to other websites are provided for convenience. We are not responsible for the content, availability or
    privacy practices of those sites.
  </p>

  <h2>Shows and events</h2>
  <p>
    Event dates, line-ups, venues and prices may change or events may be cancelled. Always confirm details with us or the
    ticket seller before travelling.
  </p>

  <h2>No professional advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this site is legal, financial or professional advice, including any information about demos, contracts or
    releases.
  </p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>
    Spotted a mistake, or want something credited differently or removed? Email
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will fix it.
  </p>
</TextPage>
